 dead and Yuji encounters Ayuya in the middle of the road to make her his bride. Dao Ma is beside himself with rage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c1a23RER2kxVhd13yKJf6DdBsHF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"110156","synopsis":"Shu gets involved in Dao Ma's revenge battle. The heads of five families which has now become four are on the road for the blood of Zhi Shilang.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iyKmSJPpdguO6ZhsQlEIgYPngjJ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"110274","synopsis":"The huge sandstorm disrupts Dao Ma's battle for revenge. But Ayuya decides to leave the group to seek her own personal revenge for her father.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4alIThJnhAp7mMCoQLFb8lbRUAZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"p